        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s96o",
          "text": "Commercial truck accidents differ from car accidents in several ways, including their causes. Commercial trucks are heavier and larger than passenger vehicles, and trucks haul trailers with significant loads. This size and weight difference make trucks more difficult to stop than other vehicles; it also contributes to blind spots or areas where truck drivers cannot see smaller vehicles that may surround them.",
